	Nothing wrong with it. If it's already holy water, why worry? You
can't bless holy water, since it's already blessed (and therefore holy).
Similarly, Unholy water is already cursed. 
	To bless a potion of water (always clear) drop it on an altar of
your alignment (your god's) and pray. If He/She is satisfied with you,
you get your water blessed and thus holy water. Simple, eh? 
	To get your god happy, sacrifice (#offer) fresh corpses on the altar
and don't pray to often.

